<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Styled multi-page project by Shubhanshu Kushwaha.">
  <title>Shubhanshu's Styled Multi-Page Project</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #1f3a93;
      --accent: #f4a261;
      --bg: #f8f9fc;
      --text: #222;
      --radius: 8px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 1rem;
      padding-bottom: 2px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent);
    }

    main {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .page {
      display: none;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, .08);
    }

    .page:target,
    body:not(:has(.page:target)) #home {
      display: block;
    }

    h2 {
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: .75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    input,
    select,
    textarea {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      padding: .5rem;
      margin-top: .25rem;
      border: 1px solid #bbb;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font: inherit;
    }

    button {
      background: var(--accent);
      border: 0;
      padding: .6rem 1.4rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover {
      filter: brightness(.92);
    }

    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
      width: 100%;
    }

    th,
    td {
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      padding: .5rem;
    }

    th {
      background: #eef1fb;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .note {
      background: #fff8ec;
      border-left: 5px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Shubhanshu's Site</h1>
    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#register">Register</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
      <a href="#design">Design Note</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section id="home" class="page">
      <h2>Home</h2>
      <p>Welcome to my styled multi-page project. My name is Shubhanshu Kushwaha, and I am a BCA student.</p>
      <p>This project demonstrates a multi-page website using HTML and CSS.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="page">
      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <table>
        <tr>
          <th>Name</th>
          <td>Shubhanshu Kushwaha</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>Student ID</th>
          <td>BCAI2026081</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>Course</th>
          <td>BCA</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>Mobile</th>
          <td>8887955490</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <th>Interests</th>
          <td>Web Development, Music, Cricket</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section id="register" class="page">
      <h2>Registration</h2>
      <form action="#">
        <label>
          Name
          <input type="text" value="Shubhanshu Kushwaha" required>
        </label>

        <label>
          Student ID
          <input type="text" value="BCAI2026081" required>
        </label>

        <label>
          Mobile
          <input type="tel" value="8887955490" required>
        </label>

        <label>
          Email
          <input type="email" required>
        </label>

        <label>
          Course
          <select>
            <option selected>BCA</option>
            <option>B.Tech</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <button type="submit">Register</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" class="page">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><strong>Name:</strong> Shubhanshu Kushwaha</p>
      <p><strong>Mobile:</strong> 8887955490</p>

      <form action="#">
        <label>
          Name
          <input type="text" value="Shubhanshu Kushwaha">
        </label>

        <label>
          Message
          <textarea rows="4"></textarea>
        </label>

        <button type="submit">Send</button>
      </form>
    </section>

    <section id="design" class="page">
      <h2>Design Choices</h2>
      <div class="note">
        <p><strong>Colour:</strong> Deep blue represents trust and professionalism, with an orange accent for buttons.</p>
        <p><strong>Typography:</strong> System font stack for fast loading and 1.6 line-height for readable paragraphs.</p>
        <p><strong>Layout:</strong> Content is capped at 800px. White cards on a light-grey background create depth.</p>
        <p><strong>Maintainability:</strong> Colours are stored in CSS variables so the theme can be changed easily.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <small>&copy; 2026 Shubhanshu Kushwaha | BCA</small>
  </footer>
</body>

</html>